Hi all,

Since coredumpcentral died a while back there has been no real 
definitive collection of Rogue binaries and source code. A couple of 
places that have binaries and source code are still available, although 
none has them all.

I have taken it as my task to find ALL versions of Rogue and it's direct 
offspring to archive and make available for the future. The archive can 
be found at http://www.roguelikedevelopment.org/archive/index.php

I would like to ask all roguelike fans out there to look through old 
harddrives, floppies and the net in search for some really rare files 
that were present on coredumpcentral.

Lars Helgeland has kindly provided "a list of the 37 filenames from 
Google's cache, with descriptions taken from a copy of the download page 
from December 2003 that I found on an old hard drive". If you have any 
of the files marked as not found, then please send them to me!

BR,
Björn Bergström
roguelikedevelopment.org

